Da">Contacte-nous</a></span></div></div></div></div><div data-test="footer-guarantee-link-container" class="FooterExtensionstyles__ShopGuarantee-sc-9g02ez-8 FekQp"><span data-test="footer-guarantee-title" class="FooterExtensionstyles__StyledText-sc-9g02ez-4 euCIlU Text__BaseText-aa2o0i-0 jBMSQG"><span class="Markup__StyledMarkup-ar1l9g-0 bTYWAd">Garantie LEGO® officielle</span></span><div class="FooterExtensionstyles__GuaranteeItems-sc-9g02ez-9 fGZnXJ"><a data-test="footer-guarantee-link" class="FooterExtensionstyles__StyledLink-sc-9g02ez-14 fukQQa" href="https://www.lego.com/fr-fr/page/shipping-handling"><div class="FooterExtensionstyles__LinkImage-sc-9g02ez-11 FooterExtensionstyles__StyledLinkImage-sc-9g02ez-12 fTgFAp LazyImageNewstyles__Container-sc-1r33gxx-0 jODRgJ"><div class="LazyImageNewstyles__Placeholder-sc-1r33gxx-2 SEdhh"></div></div><span class="FooterExtensionstyles__GuaranteeText-sc-9g02ez-10 cycVIK Text__BaseText-aa2o0i-0 ctvIrY"><span class="Markup__StyledMarkup-ar1l9g-0 bTYWAd">Livraison GRATUITE à partir de 55 € d'achat ! Toute l’année.</span></span></a><a data-test="footer-guarantee-link" class="FooterExtensionstyles__StyledLink-sc-9g02ez-14 fukQQa" href="https://www.lego.com/fr-fr/vip"><div class="FooterExtensionstyles__LinkImage-sc-9g02ez-11 FooterExtensionstyles__StyledLinkImage-sc-9g02ez-12 fTgFAp LazyImageNewstyles__Container-sc-1r33gxx-0 jODRgJ"><div class="LazyImageNewstyles__Placeholder-sc-1r33gxx-2 SEdhh"></div></div><span class="FooterExtensionstyles__GuaranteeText-sc-9g02ez-10 cycVIK Text__BaseText-aa2o0i-0 ctvIrY"><span class="Markup__StyledMarkup-ar1l9g-0 bTYWAd">Gagne des points pour tout achat et bénéficie de promotions réservées aux membres.</span></span></a><a href="https://www.lego.com/fr-fr/service/replacementparts" data-test="footer-guarantee-link" class="FooterExtensionstyles__StyledLink-sc-9g02ez-14 fukQQa Linksstyles__Anchor-sc-707k3h-0 cUvfDa"><div class="FooterExtensionstyles__LinkImage-sc-9g02ez-11 FooterExtensionstyles__StyledLinkImage-sc-9g02ez-12 fTgFAp LazyImageNewstyles__Container-sc-1r33gxx-0 jODRgJ"><div class="LazyImageNewstyles__Placeholder-sc-1r33gxx-2 SEdhh"></div></div><span class="FooterExtensionstyles__GuaranteeText-sc-9g02ez-10 cycVIK Text__BaseText-aa2o0i-0 ctvIrY"><span class="Markup__StyledMarkup-ar1l9g-0 bTYWAd">Il te manque des pièces ou des instructions ? Dis-le-nous et nous te les enverrons directement chez toi.</span></span></a></div></div></div></div><div class="FooterSocialstyles__Container-sc-5e6xkh-0 ivKeEF"><div class="FooterSocialstyles__Wrapper-sc-5e6xkh-1 fwXPLR"><div class="FooterSocialstyles__Email-sc-5e6xkh-2 evnEBl"><div class="FooterSocialstyles__TextsWrapper-sc-5e6xkh-4 fHCGnQ"><span class="FooterSocialstyles__StyledTexts-sc-5e6xkh-3 fgBrti Text__BaseText-aa2o0i-0 jBMSQG"><span class="Markup__StyledMarkup-ar1l9g-0 bTYWAd">S'inscrire aux e-mails de la Boutique LEGO®</span></span><span class="FooterSocialstyles__StyledTexts-sc-5e6xkh-3 fgBrti Text__BaseText-aa2o0i-0 gdMazF"><span class="Markup__StyledMarkup-ar1l9g-0 bTYWAd">Découvre en premier les nouveaux ensembles, produits exclusifs, promotions et événements se déroulant dans les LEGO Stores !</span></span></div><div class="FooterSocialstyles__InputWrapper-sc-5e6xkh-5 hsJhfB"><div data-test="input-with-button" class="InputWithButtonstyles__Wrapper-g0osdd-0 OAXDN"><div class="InputWithButtonstyles__InputWrapper-g0osdd-1 kPjcmC"><div class="Inputstyles__InputWrapper-sc-12nwzc4-9 jZpUMF"><label tabindex="-1" type="text" class="Inputstyles__Label-sc-12nwzc4-0 MuiGD"><input type="text" aria-invalid="false" name="subscribe" data-testid="input-with-button-input" class="Inputstyles__InputField-sc-12nwzc4-1 fbDilL"><span tabindex="-1" type="text" class="Inputstyles__LabelText-sc-12nwzc4-2 gtvwUj">Ton adresse e-mail</span></label></div></div><button kind="submit" type="submit" data-testid="input-with-button-button" class="InputWithButtonstyles__StyledButton-g0osdd-2 iJHjNV Button__Base-sc-1jdmsyi-0 ioWfsL">Inscris-toi</button></div></div></div><div data-test="footer-social-links" class="FooterSocialstyles__SocialWrapper-sc-5e6xkh-7 jsuAWV"><span class="FooterSocialstyles__StyledTexts-sc-5e6xkh-3 fgBrti Text__BaseText-aa2o0i-0 jBMSQG"><span class="Markup__StyledMarkup-ar1l9g-0 bTYWAd">Suis-nous</span></span><div class="FooterSocialstyles__SocialButtons-sc-5e6xkh-8 hUiUSB"><a href="https://www.facebook.com/LEGO/" class="FooterSocialstyles__SocialLink-sc-5e6xkh-9 jBIsGo Linksstyles__Anchor-sc-707k3h-0 cUvfDa"><img src="image%20ilustr_fichiers/facebook-94eac66c1910a1b2ef861ad82c685d68.png" alt="facebook"></a><a href="https://twitter.com/LEGO_Group" class="FooterSocialstyles__SocialLink-sc-5e6xkh-9 jBIsGo Linksstyles__Anchor-sc-707k3h-0 cUvfDa"><img src="image%20ilustr_fichiers/twitter-406b34968a0833ec9d67c03d0f96704c.png" alt="twitter"></a><a href="https://www.instagram.com/lego" class="FooterSocialstyles__SocialLink-sc-5e6xkh-9 jBIsGo Linksstyles__Anchor-sc-707k3h-0 cUvfDa"><img src="image%20ilustr_fichiers/instagram-56ae5054868540f5754edc4a5c25d9c7.png" alt="instagram"></a><a href="https://m.youtube.com/user/LEGO" class="FooterSocialstyles__SocialLink-sc-5e6xkh-9 jBIsGo Linksstyles__Anchor-sc-707k3h-0 cUvfDa"><img src="image%20ilustr_fichiers/youtube-9e7818b52c1ef02dfa652fe32d028ce5.png" alt="youtube"></a></div></div></div></div><div class="Footerstyles__Container-sc-1w150qw-0 dXyqAt"><div class="MediaQuery__MediaHideable-sc-1poqfy2-0 iQcoKI"><div class="Footerstyles__Wrapper-sc-1w150qw-1 Footerstyles__BottomLinksWrapper-sc-1w150qw-2 kobvhW"><div class="Footerstyles__FindStoreAndLinksWrapper-sc-1w150qw-4 dAlPgZ"><div class="FindLegoStorestyles__Wrapper-sc-3kl750-0 hEviFr"><span class="FindLegoStorestyles__Title-sc-3kl750-3 cGgTjG Text__BaseText-aa2o0i-0 fHbuOQ"><span class="Markup__StyledMarkup-ar1l9g-0 bTYWAd">Trouve un LEGO® Store</span></span><form method="get" action="https://www.lego.com/stores/stores" class="FindLegoStorestyles__Form-sc-3kl750-1 esZDsK"><div data-test="input-with-button" class="InputWithButtonstyles__Wrapper-g0osdd-0 OAXDN"><div class="InputWithButtonstyles__InputWrapper-g0osdd-1 kPjcmC"><div class="Inputstyles__InputWrapper-sc-12nwzc4-9 jZpUMF"><label for="find-lego-store" tabindex="-1" type="text" class="Inputstyles__Label-sc-12nwzc4-0 MuiGD"><input type="text" aria-invalid="false" id="find-lego-store" name="search" data-testid="input-with-button-input" class="Inputstyles__InputField-sc-12nwzc4-1 fbDilL"><span tabindex="-1" type="text" class="Inputstyles__LabelText-sc-12nwzc4-2 gtvwUj">Trouver un LEGO® Store</span></label></div></div><button kind="submit" type="submit" data-testid="input-with-button-button" aria-label="Find a Store" class="InputWithButtonstyles__StyledButton-g0osdd-2 iJHjNV Button__Base-sc-1jdmsyi-0 ioWfsL"><svg width="16px" height="16px" viewBox="0 0 18 28" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M1.825 28L18 14 1.825 0 0 1.715 14.196 14 0 26.285z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></button></div></form><p color="grey_dark" class="FindLegoStorestyles__InformationText-sc-3kl750-2 cXkmeC Text__BaseText-aa2o0i-0 fZPGmf"><span class="Markup__StyledMarkup-ar1l9g-0 bTYWAd">Entre ta ville, ton code postal ou ton pays pour trouver le LEGO Store officiel le plus proche de chez toi.</span></p></div><div><a data-test="footer-subscribe-catalogue-lego" class="FooterLinksstyles__LinkWrapper-sc-1ubzipc-0 gvbGwu" href="https://www.lego.com/fr-fr/catalogues"><span class="Text__BaseText-aa2o0i-0 lfflsW"><span class="Markup__StyledMarkup-ar1l9g-0 bTYWAd">Catalogue LEGO</span></span></a><a data-test="footer-subscribe-mini-modèles" class="FooterLinksstyles__LinkWrapper-sc-1ubzipc-0 gvbGwu" href="https://www.lego.com/fr-fr/minibuilds"><span class="Text__BaseText-aa2o0i-0 lfflsW"><span class="Markup__StyledMarkup-ar1l9g-0 bTYWAd">Mini-modèles</span></span></a></div></div><div class="FooterBottomLinksstyles__Wrapper-sc-379ofr-0 MKWmz"><div class="FooterBottomLinksstyles__Column-sc-379ofr-4 gBhdsb"><span class="FooterBottomLinksstyles__Title-sc-379ofr-3 eNwpzF Text__BaseText-aa2o0i-0 fHbuOQ"><span class="Markup__StyledMarkup-ar1l9g-0 bTYWAd">À propos de nous</span></span><ul><li><a href="https://www.lego.com/fr-fr/aboutus" data-test="footer-links-list-item" class="FooterBottomLinksstyles__StyledLink-sc-379ofr-1 fMpbJG Linksstyles__Anchor-sc-707k3h-0 cUvfDa">À propos du Groupe LEGO</a></li><li><a href="https://www.lego.com/fr-fr/aboutus/news-room" data-test="footer-links-list-item" class="FooterBottomLinksstyles__StyledLink-sc-379ofr-1 fMpbJG Linksstyles__Anchor-sc-707k3h-0 cUvfDa">Nouveautés LEGO®</a></li><li><a href="https://www.lego.com/fr-fr/aboutus/responsibility" data-test="footer-links-list-item" class="FooterBottomLinksstyles__StyledLink-sc-379ofr-1 fMpbJG Linksstyles__Anchor-sc-707k3h-0 cUvfDa">Notre responsabilité</a></li><li><a href="https://www.lego.com/fr-fr/aboutus/responsibility/caring-ethical-and-transparent/transparency-in-supply-chains-statement" data-test="footer-links-list-item" class="FooterBottomLinksstyles__StyledLink-sc-379ofr-1 fMpbJG Linksstyles__Anchor-sc-707k3h-0 cUvfDa">Déclaration de transparence de la chaîne logistique</a></li><li><a href="https://www.lego.com/fr-fr/aboutus/lego-group/product-safety" data-test="footer-links-list-item" class="FooterBottomLinksstyles__StyledLink-sc-379ofr-1 fMpbJG Linksstyles__Anchor-sc-707k3h-0 cUvfDa">Certification produit LEGO</a></li><li><a href="https://www.lego.com/fr-fr/careers" data-test="footer-links-list-item" class="FooterBottomLinksstyles__StyledLink-sc-379ofr-1 fMpbJG Linksstyles__Anchor-sc-707k3h-0 cUvfDa">Emplois LEGO</a></li></ul></div><div class="FooterBottomLinksstyles__Column-sc-379ofr-4 gBhdsb"><span class="FooterBottomLinksstyles__Title-sc-379ofr-3 eNwpzF Text__BaseText-aa2o0i-0 fHbuOQ"><span class="Markup__StyledMarkup-ar1l9g-0 bTYWAd">Aide</span></span><ul><li><a href="https://www.lego.com/fr-fr/service" data-test="footer-links-list-item" class="FooterBottomLinksstyles__StyledLink-sc-379ofr-1 fMpbJG L